1
00:00:20,100 --> 00:00:25,379
The heavy latch falls in the frame,

2
00:00:25,579 --> 00:00:31,120
Cold rain is beating on the glass.

3
00:00:31,300 --> 00:00:36,579
I whisper in the dark your name,

4
00:00:36,740 --> 00:00:42,200
And feel the shivering shadows pass.

5
00:00:42,350 --> 00:00:47,829
I will not die a quiet death,

6
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:53,280
Behind a fortress built of stone!

7
00:00:53,460 --> 00:00:59,090
I offer you my every breath,

8
00:00:59,179 --> 00:01:07,280
Or I will walk this road alone!

9
00:01:07,500 --> 00:01:12,719
I trace the mirror in the hall,

10
00:01:12,900 --> 00:01:18,219
I see my mother's haunted eyes.

11
00:01:18,400 --> 00:01:23,799
The ghost that made an empire fall,

12
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:29,620
The man who vanished with the lies.

13
00:01:29,799 --> 00:01:35,069
Stand in the fire, hold my soul,

14
00:01:35,299 --> 00:01:40,620
Don't hide behind a frightened trace!

15
00:01:40,799 --> 00:01:46,219
Give me your heart or lose the whole,

16
00:01:46,400 --> 00:01:51,739
Before the shadows take your place!

17
00:01:54,849 --> 00:01:59,959
At Lotus we will face the trial,

18
00:02:00,379 --> 00:02:05,450
I'll bare the blood beneath my skin.

19
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:10,930
No safety in a broken smile,

20
00:02:11,439 --> 00:02:16,849
Tell me you'll fight, tell me you'll win!

21
00:02:17,120 --> 00:02:22,419
Speak now and claim what you desire,

22
00:02:22,599 --> 00:02:28,020
Or watch me vanish in the night!

23
00:02:28,199 --> 00:02:33,620
Step through the ashes and the fire,

24
00:02:33,800 --> 00:02:42,580
Or be a ghost in fading light!

25
00:03:01,800 --> 00:03:07,219
Either you claim me in the fire,

26
00:03:07,400 --> 00:03:12,819
Or watch the ashes take desire,

27
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:18,219
Let the silence fill the space,

28
00:03:18,400 --> 00:03:23,110
Before we lose our final grace.